{"document":1,"title":"user in #eac54add:c3023a45_5: I'm looking to buy a new board game and was wonder...","updated_at":"2023-02-11T09:55:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I think I'll pick up a copy of Azul and play it with my neighbors next time we have a game night. I'm sure they'll love it, especially since we had a great time playing Carcassonne together two weeks ago. Do you have any tips on how to improve my chances of winning at Azul?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:c3023a45_5\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #eac54add:2ea6fda4_1: I've been having some issues with my bathroom fan...","updated_at":"2023-02-21T04:03:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been having some issues with my bathroom fan lately, it's been making a weird noise when it's on. I was wondering if you could give me some tips on how to troubleshoot the problem or if I should just replace it. By the way, I replaced my bathroom towels about three weeks ago, and it's amazing how much of a difference it's made - the new ones are so much softer!","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:2ea6fda4_1\"}"}
{"document":1,"title":"user in #eac54add:c3023a45_5: I'm looking to buy a new board game and was wonder...","updated_at":"2023-02-11T09:55:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm looking to buy a new board game and was wondering if you could recommend something similar to Ticket to Ride. By the way, I've been on a roll with train-themed games lately, having won a game against my roommate two weeks ago. Oh, and I also had a game night with my neighbors around the same time, and we played two rounds of Carcassonne.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:c3023a45_5\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #eac54add:773aebbd_3: I've been trying to get into a better habit of flo...","updated_at":"2023-01-18T15:34:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm glad you provided those tips. I was thinking about my bathroom scale, and I just realized I've been weighing myself every morning since I replaced the old one with a new digital scale from Target about 3 weeks ago. I've lost about 2 pounds, which is great motivation to keep going. Do you have any advice on how to keep the bathroom scale clean and accurate?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:773aebbd_3\"}"}
{"document":4,"title":"user in #eac54add:7966888b_2: I'm thinking of getting some new plants, and I was...","updated_at":"2023-03-01T22:41:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm thinking of getting some new plants, and I was wondering if you could recommend any low-maintenance options that would thrive in indoor conditions. By the way, I recently repotted my spider plant 3 weeks ago and it's doing much better now with more room to grow.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:7966888b_2\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #eac54add:2ea6fda4_1: I've been having some issues with my bathroom fan...","updated_at":"2023-02-21T04:03:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I was thinking about my bathroom mat as well. I replaced it about three weeks ago, and it's a memory foam one, so it feels really good under my feet. The old one was getting all soggy and gross. Do you have any tips on how to clean memory foam bathroom mats, or how often I should clean them?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:2ea6fda4_1\"}"}
{"document":4,"title":"user in #eac54add:7966888b_2: I'm thinking of getting some new plants, and I was...","updated_at":"2023-03-01T22:41:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"That's really great to know! I've had some issues with stuffy air in my apartment, so I think a peace lily would be a great addition. Since I've already had some experience with repotting my spider plant 3 weeks ago, I'm feeling more confident about taking care of a new plant. Do you think a peace lily would do well in a room with low light?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"eac54add:7966888b_2\"}"}

